Package: libfprint-2-2
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Description: async fingerprint library of fprint project, shared libraries
 This is a rebuild of upstream libfprint with the out-of-tree EgisTec EH576
 (egis0576, USB 1c7a:0576) driver compiled in. It keeps the stock Debian
 binary package name so it is a drop-in replacement: the unmodified system
 fprintd loads it through the same libfprint-2.so.2 soname, no fprintd
 rebuild needed.
 .
 Includes the egis0576 suspend/resume systemd-sleep hook, the fprintd
 resume-wait gate, and the no-autosuspend udev rule for the sensor.

